# Copy to .env.local for local dev. Committed file is an example only.
#
# The Turnstile SITE key is public — it is embedded in the page by design.
# Its SECRET counterpart is set in the Cloudflare Pages dashboard and must
# never appear in this repo or in any VITE_-prefixed variable, because
# everything prefixed VITE_ is inlined into the client bundle.
VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=
